=2 Walkthrough
* After speaking with {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}, proceed to the Beastman Ensign at the border line of (H-8)/(I-8) in {z:Fort Karugo-Narugo (S)} to enter {z:Ghoyu's Reverie}.
* Enter the BCNM and defeat 2 {m:Yagudo Guards|Yagudo Guard} and a {m:Yagudo Carrier}. They are low level and easily defeated by even level 75 players.
** The {m:Yagudo Carrier} will try to run away, so kill it first.
